}","role":"user"}],"model":"Gemma-4-26B","seed":42,"stream":false,"temperature":0.8}

{"max_tokens":8192,"messages":[{"content":"Translate the supplied text from Kannada to English. Preserve meaning, important details and tone. Return only the translation.
